.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH moi 1  "moi 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
moi \- moi — one binary that runs a Linux server: state capture, AI context, health checks, Uptime Kuma sync, backups and one\-command rebuilds
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmoi\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-secrets\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
moi — one binary that runs a Linux server: state capture, AI context, health checks, Uptime Kuma sync, backups and one\-command rebuilds
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR [default: /etc/moi/moi.toml]
Config file
.TP
\fB\-\-secrets\fR \fI<SECRETS>\fR
Secrets file [default: secrets.toml next to the config file]
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output where supported
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Only print warnings and errors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
moi\-init(1)
Discover the server, write config, install the service, take the first snapshot
.TP
moi\-snapshot(1)
Capture the full server state into the versioned state dir
.TP
moi\-log(1)
Show the change history of the server
.TP
moi\-diff(1)
Show what changed in a snapshot (default: the latest)
.TP
moi\-context(1)
Regenerate CONTEXT.md for AI assistants, or share it with an expiring link
.TP
moi\-notes(1)
Edit the owner\*(Aqs notes merged into CONTEXT.md
.TP
moi\-audit(1)
Find what is not backed up, not restorable, lost on reboot, or on the wrong disk
.TP
moi\-check(1)
Run health checks
.TP
moi\-monitors(1)
Uptime Kuma monitors
.TP
moi\-backup(1)
Back up databases and identity data locally and off\-site
.TP
moi\-push(1)
Upload the encrypted state bundle off\-site
.TP
moi\-pull(1)
Download the latest state bundle (on a new machine)
.TP
moi\-restore(1)
Rebuild this machine from a state bundle and the data backup
.TP
moi\-verify(1)
Check that everything that should run, runs (also after every boot)
.TP
moi\-recovery\-card(1)
Print what you must keep outside the server to rebuild it
.TP
moi\-firewall(1)
Host firewall rules managed by moi
.TP
moi\-migrate(1)
Move a server from legacy scripts and cron jobs to moi
.TP
moi\-config(1)
Configuration
.TP
moi\-status(1)
Daemon status, last results and next scheduled jobs
.TP
moi\-daemon(1)
Run the daemon (used by moi.service)
.TP
moi\-uninstall(1)
Remove moi and restore anything it replaced
.TP
moi\-ssh(1)
SSH to this server from anywhere, through a tunnel
.TP
moi\-completions(1)
Print a shell completion script (bash, zsh, fish)
.TP
moi\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
